==History==
2025
*The Hunter's Evolution was available on 24/2/2025, before its release date, as an unintended glitch, in the [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Evo Lumberjack]] Draft Event. Supercell fixed this glitch with a maintenance break.
*The Hunter's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/3/2025, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/3/2025)|March 2025 Update]].
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Evolved Hunter's hitpoints by 0.11%. It also fixed a few bugs where the Evolved Hunter would not net other [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] or air troops not getting grounded by Evolved Hunter’s net.
*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Hunter's first attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 0.8 seconds), decreased the Evolved Hunter's net duration to 3 seconds (from 4 seconds), and increased its cooldown to 5 seconds (from 4 seconds).
*On 28/11/25, the Hunter Evo was given out for free on Black Friday.

