==Trivia==
*The Hunter is 1 of 2 evolved [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that can deal damage to multiple units with one attack without an area damage radius, the other being [[Electro Dragon/Evolution|Electro Dragon]].
*If the Evolved Hunter performed his attack right before dying while being cursed by the [[Mother Witch]], it is possible for the Cursed Hog to spawn right inside these bullets, destroying it immediately.
*In the [[Cards|card]]'s description, the "''Be very, very quiet''" line is from [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elmer_Fudd Elmer Fudd]'s signature line, saying "''Be very, very quiet. I'm hunting rabbits.''".
*Upon deployment, the Evolved Hunter exclaims “''Got ya in my sights!''”, “''Into the net you go!''”, or "''Sky’s closed!''", and when netting enemy troops, he may say “''Trap like a rat!''”, "''You're mine!''", or "''Gotcha!''".
**The Hunter is 1 of 9 evolved troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Bomber/Evolution|Bomber]], [[Wizard/Evolution|Wizard]], [[Goblin Cage/Evolution|Goblin Brawler]], [[Witch/Evolution|Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A./Evolution|P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Executioner/Evolution|Executioner]], [[Mega Knight/Evolution|Mega Knight]], and [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack]].
***Also, the Hunter is 1 of 6 evolved troops whose regular troop do not speak any distinct words when on the field, the others being Bomber, Goblin Brawler, Witch, Executioner, and Mega Knight.
*The Hunter is the subject of certain cosmetics in the game. More specifically:
**The Hunter is the subject of an [[Emotes|Emote]].
